
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>PIXEL SNAKE</title>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html, body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100%;
  background: #071009;
}

body {
  color: #a5ff69;
  font-family: monospace;
}

.menu {
  min-height: 100vh;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 30px 20px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;

  background-color: #071009;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(#193b22 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, #193b22 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 20px 20px;
}

.menu::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background: radial-gradient(
    ellipse at center,
    rgba(35, 100, 44, 0.5),
    rgba(7, 16, 9, 0.94) 80%
  );
}

.content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 400px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}

.small {
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  color: #7cae83;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(56px, 15vw, 76px);
  margin: 20px 0 5px;
  color: #a5ff69;
  text-shadow: 4px 4px #286332,
               8px 8px #102b17;
}

.subtitle {
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  color: #8ab891;
}

.snake {
  width: 240px;
  height: 220px;
  position: relative;
  margin: 28px 0;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px #5dff6340);
}

.pixel {
  position: absolute;
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  background: #68df58;
  border: 3px solid #24532b;
  box-shadow: inset -5px -5px #32853a;
}

.p2 { left:69px; top:35px; }
.p3 { left:103px; top:35px; }
.p4 { left:137px; top:35px; }
.p5 { left:137px; top:69px; }
.p6 { left:137px; top:103px; }
.p7 { left:103px; top:103px; }
.p8 { left:69px; top:103px; }
.p9 { left:35px; top:103px; }
.p10 { left:35px; top:137px; }

.head {
  position: absolute;
  left: 35px;
  top: 35px;
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  background: #a5ff69;
  border: 3px solid #315c2d;
  z-index: 2;
}

.eye {
  position: absolute;
  right: 3px;
  top: 4px;
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  background: #102515;
}

.eye.second { top: 18px; }

.apple {
  position: absolute;
  left: 180px;
  top: 140px;
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  background: #ff4855;
  border: 3px solid #a62435;
  box-shadow: inset -4px -4px #c92d39;
}

.apple::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  width: 5px;
  height: 8px;
  background: #a5ff69;
  top: -9px;
  left: 8px;
}

.buttons {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 300px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 18px;
}

button {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 62px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: #a5ff69;
  color: #102413;
  font: bold 16px monospace;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow:
    inset 4px 4px #d5ffb6,
    inset -4px -4px #45943a,
    0 7px #28542d;
}

button.secondary {
  background: #12251a;
  color: #a5ff82;
  border: 2px solid #47764a;
  box-shadow: inset 4px 4px #315b38,
              0 7px #020503;
}

button:active {
  transform: translateY(4px);
}

.footer {
  margin-top: 30px;
  color: #6c9672;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 2;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="menu">
  <main class="content">
    <div class="small">◆ PIXEL ARCADE ◆</div>
    <h1>SNAKE</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">THE CLASSIC GAME</div>

    <div class="snake">
      <div class="pixel p2"></div>
      <div class="pixel p3"></div>
      <div class="pixel p4"></div>
      <div class="pixel p5"></div>
      <div class="pixel p6"></div>
      <div class="pixel p7"></div>
      <div class="pixel p8"></div>
      <div class="pixel p9"></div>
      <div class="pixel p10"></div>

      <div class="head">
        <span class="eye"></span>
        <span class="eye second"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="apple"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="buttons">
      <button>▶ ИГРАТЬ</button>
      <button class="secondary">♙ АККАУНТ</button>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      INSERT COIN TO BEGIN<br>
      VERSION 0.1
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
